<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[min(58vh,640px)] sm:min-h-[62vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368160/eurocert/lca-hero-bg.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_45%]" alt="" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#030a16]/92 via-[#030a16]/55 to-[#030a16]/20" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/45 via-transparent to-[#030a16]/88" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">ISO 14025 &amp; LCA-Aligned EPD Support</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Environmental Product Declaration <span class="text-eurogold-400">(EPD)</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-4">Verified EPD certification support by Eurocert Asia â€” transparent environmental product performance for global supply chains, green building, and ESG reporting.</p><p class="text-white/80 text-xs md:text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">An EPD is based on Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) methodology and provides credible, standardised environmental information for products used across sustainable procurement and responsible markets.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Get EPD Support <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all" href="/contact/">Request a Proposal</a></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-start"><div class="space-y-6 min-w-0"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Understanding EPD</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is an Environmental Product <span class="text-euro-600">Declaration (EPD)?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">An Environmental Product Declaration (EPD) is a standardised environmental report that communicates the environmental impacts of a product throughout its life cycle. EPDs are developed using Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) data and are commonly aligned with international standards.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia supports organisations seeking EPD verification and certification support for products across manufacturing, construction, industrial, and consumer sectors â€” helping strengthen environmental transparency, improve sustainability credibility, and support market access requirements.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-euro-200 bg-euro-50 text-euro-700 text-xs heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">ISO 14025</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-euro-200 bg-euro-50 text-euro-700 text-xs heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">ISO 14040</span><span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-euro-200 bg-euro-50 text-euro-700 text-xs heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">ISO 14044</span></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">EPD communicates</h4></div><ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Carbon footprint</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Energy consumption</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Water usage</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Resource consumption</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Waste generation</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Environmental emissions</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Product sustainability performance</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="w-full min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-24 self-start"><figure class="w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1778836607/ChatGPT_Image_May_15_2026_02_46_31_PM_ykvk9i.png" class="w-full h-auto block" alt="Environmental product declaration and life cycle assessment visualization" width="1440" height="810" decoding="async"/></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">EPD <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2><p class="text-slate-500 mt-2 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto">Independent EPD verification support by Eurocert Asia. Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert S.A., Athens, Greece â€” a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-database text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">EPD-Ready Environmental Data</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Develop EPD-ready environmental data aligned with program and PCR requirements.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-60