div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Documentation &amp; Submission Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Support EPD documentation, technical review, and submission processes.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-seedling text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ESG Reporting Credibility</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Improve sustainability and ESG reporting credibility with verified product data.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-10 lg:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="w-full min-w-0 order-2 lg:order-1 space-y-4"><figure class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto lg:max-w-none rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl shadow-black/30 border border-white/10 bg-white/5"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1780722794/AQMBgCNBLyzycY15iZx_y1hT6k6IvZKLqiD-J8jOnoPfqFcR8XEZu_GAh8ZHQmHUPBL0Wa5AvDlqQZnL0aJ25h8foKbBaQ9SwMi4jUYtHn3Gw2X8UzRI-Iw8Mt0W7UbUQletBp0HL7hGc2Fy8nOfNwgvdqXHVg.jpeg_b41skb.jpg" class="w-full h-auto block" alt="EPD certification and environmental product sustainability" width="1200" height="800" decoding="async"/></figure><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-e