ass="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Green Building Support</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Support for green building programs and sustainable construction projects.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-chart-pie text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Stronger ESG Reporting</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Better ESG and sustainability reporting with standardised product data.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Stakeholder Trust</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Enhanced stakeholder trust from transparent, verified disclosures.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-cart-shopping text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Sustainable Procurement</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Support for sustainable procurement and tender requirements.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-start"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Verification Scope</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What Eurocert Asia <span class="text-euro-600">Verifies in an EPD</span></h2><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-4 max-w-xl">Eurocert Asia supports verification and review of important EPD components, including:</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden"><span class="text-3xl heading-font font-bold text-euro-100 absolute -top-1 right-3">01</span><div class="relative z-10"><h4 class="text-euro-600 heading-font font-bold uppercase text-xs sm:text-sm mb-2 pr-6 leading-snug">Product Category Rule (PCR) Conformity</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Review of product-specific rules and applicable environmental reporting requirements.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden"><span class="text-3xl heading-font font-bold text-euro-100 absolute -top-1 right-3">02</span><div class="relative z-10"><h4 class="text-euro-600 heading-font font-bold uppercase text-xs sm:text-sm mb-2 pr-6 leading-snug">Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) Verification</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Assessment of e